e will be captured in different light intensities and pose. These images are stored in the database. This is training. When the person faces the camera, his/her images will be verified with that of the trained images in the database. This is testing. The final step is the prediction, which tells us if it is a success ( when there is a match between the image captured and the images in the database) or a failure ( when there is no match between the image captured and the images in the database).","topics":[],"score":288464,"global_rank":27560,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5666},{"name":"zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","owner":"zaro0508","html_url":"https://github.com/zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"A set of Sceptre resolvers to help identify a stack","topics":[],"score":288450,"global_rank":27575,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5667},{"name":"renysaldivar/Charms","owner":"renysaldivar","html_url":"https://github.com/renysaldivar/Charms","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288440,"global_rank":27580,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5668},{"name":"buhruce/NinjA","owner":"buhruce","html_url":"https://github.com/buhruce/NinjA","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"An api scraper for a browser game called Earth Empires.","topics":["earth2025","earthempires"],"score":288409,"global_rank":27597,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5669},{"name":"Sage-Bionetworks/sysbioDCCjsonschemas","owner":"Sage-Bionetworks","html_url":"https://github.com/Sage-Bionetworks/sysbioDCCjsonschemas","stars":1,"forks":7,"watchers":9,"issues":8,"language":"Python","description":"SysBio DCC JSON schemas","topics":[],"score":288395,"global_rank":27607,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5670},{"name":"AccelByte/extend-vivox-authorization-ser